(snapshot 2026-10-07, upstream commit 3929462652695bad04f0a27afb600974014a3c8b).
The list is licensed under the Mozilla Public License 2.0,
https://mozilla.org/MPL/2.0/, and the file keeps its license header. The list
is refreshed with WSurf releases, not at run time.

The Appearance color presets in WSurf/Settings/ThemePreset.swift use color
values from the Catppuccin, Nord, Dracula, and Rosé Pine palettes and from the
Gruvbox schemes published by Tinted Theming (tinted-theming/schemes, MIT).
Their notices are in WSurf/Support/Acknowledgements.json and Tools/vendored;
the Gruvbox entry is Tinted Theming's license and credits the palette's
original authors as that project does. Names are used only to identify the
palettes; WSurf is not endorsed by their authors.

